%% Admin Control Plane: Hot-Reload Configuration

sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Admin
    participant API as Admin API
    participant Config as Runtime Config<br/>(Thread-Safe)
    participant Handler as Inference Handler
    participant Req1 as Request N
    participant Req2 as Request N+1

    Note over A,Req2: Before: mode=shadow, sample_rate=0.01

    Req1->>Handler: POST /v1/infer
    Handler->>Config: GetMode()
    Config-->>Handler: shadow
    Handler->>Handler: Use Go Router + Shadow
    Handler-->>Req1: Response

    A->>API: POST /admin/optimizer<br/>X-Admin-Token: secret<br/>{mode: "rust", sample_rate: 0.25}
    activate API

    API->>API: Validate Token
    API->>Config: SetMode("rust")
    activate Config
    Config->>Config: Lock, Update, Unlock<br/>mode = rust
    Config-->>API: OK
    deactivate Config

    API->>Config: SetSampleRate(0.25)
    activate Config
    Config->>Config: Lock, Update, Unlock<br/>sample_rate = 0.25
    Config-->>API: OK
    deactivate Config

    API-->>A: 200 OK<br/>{status: "ok", current_mode: "rust", sample_rate: 0.25}
    deactivate API

    Note over Handler: No restart required!

    Req2->>Handler: POST /v1/infer<br/>(next request)
    Handler->>Config: GetMode()
    Config-->>Handler: rust
    Handler->>Config: GetSampleRate()
    Config-->>Handler: 0.25
    Handler->>Handler: Sample check: 25% use Rust
    Handler-->>Req2: Response

    Note over A,Req2: After: mode=rust, sample_rate=0.25 (live)
